SOLUTION 1  River water
    pH      6.0
    Cl      10    mg/L
    Na      10    mg/L  charge
    temp    25

SOLUTION 2  Seawater
    pH      8.1
    Cl      19000  mg/L
    Na      19000  mg/L  charge
    temp    25

MIX 1
    1   0.7
    2   0.3

SAVE SOLUTION 3

END

USE SOLUTION 3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file           mix_output3.sel
    -reset          false
    -molalities     HCl

END
